{"synopsis":"Ambil wanita tercantik kendarai kuda perang tercepat gunakan senjata terkuat satu pengendara memblokir jalan GuanDong\nSatu orang berdiri melawan sepuluh ribu pasukan mereka tunduk pada pahlawan masa peperangan ini\nOrang mengatakan jika Lu Bu tidak mati tidak akan ada kesempatan untuk mewujudkan perdamaian Saya menertawakan semua orang munafik di dunia\ntidak ada pahlawan lain selain Feng Xian Memasuki kisah hidup lebih dari seribu reinkarnasi mengalami banyak perubahan hidup ditempa menjadi baja\nBisakah Lu Bu Feng Xian saat ini menahan akhir yang tak terelakkan di Bai Men Lou","alternative_title":"Lu Bu's Life Story, Lǚbù De Rénshēng Mónǐ Qì, 吕布的人生模拟器","author":"阅文漫画","artist":"有马文化 阅文漫画","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"8b31b782-7b46-4a6d-944e-c75b22a75269","number":"153","chapter":"153","title":"","date":"2026-03-18","released":"2026-03-18","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_f01801fa-c570-49cb-83b6-dfb83ba42d6b/chapter_ch_153/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"961c2090-802c-4cf9-a6e7-564134b512ef","number":"152","chapter":"152","title":"","date":"2026-02-26","released":"2026-